<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n114436" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χορῐοειδής</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ές</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>like the afterbirth,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑμήν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>HA</u>
					561b32
				</span></i>
			, etc. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χ. χιτών</span>
			<i>choroid</i> coat of the eye, <i><span class="en">
				Ruf.
				<u>Onom.</u>
				153
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				<u>UP</u>
				10.2
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χ. μῆνιγξ,</span> of the brain,
			the <i>pia mater,</i> ib.<i><span class="en">
				8.9
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Herophil.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				Ruf.
				<u>Onom.</u>
				149
			</span></i>; so of the <i>ventricles</i> of the brain, ibid.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χ. πλέγματα</span> (called <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">συστρέμματα</span> by <i><span class="en">
				Herophil.
			</span></i>) in the brain, <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				2.719
			</span></i>.—Sts. wrongly written <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χοροειδής</span> in codd., as in <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>GA</u>
				753b22
			</span></i>, etc. Adv.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-δῶς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Steph.
					<u>in Hp.</u>
					2.373D.
				</span></i>
			</div>
